    "summary": "A woman&#039;s bag, a &#039;traistă&#039;.  Made from one piece of predominantly red fabric folded in half weftwise.  Twill woven, with a black cotton warp and wool weft; handwoven.  Repeating polychrome bands alternating with solid red bands.  Top of bag (maroon band) turned (outwards) and hand stitched.  Printed cotton cloth loops at top sides (pink and blue floral patterning on cream ground), through which is threaded a plaited bright pink woollen (with synthetic) handle (doubled).",
